# .dev.vars.example — template for local development and forks
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for `npx wrangler dev`, or set the same
# names as secrets for deployed workers:
#
#     npx wrangler secret put DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
#
# The worker's cron calls an LLM to write each piece (BYOK — bring your own
# key). At least ONE provider key is required or generation fails at runtime.
# DeepSeek is the default provider in src/worker.ts; the others are optional
# fallbacks. Ollama (local) needs no key but is not usable from a deployed
# Worker.
#
# NEVER commit real keys. This file is documentation only.

DEEPSEEK_API_KEY = "sk-<your-deepseek-key>"
MOONSHOT_API_KEY = "sk-<your-moonshot-key>"
DEEPINFRA_API_KEY = "<your-deepinfra-key>"
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY = "sk-<your-siliconflow-key>"
